recipe('cargo-map','remembered-cargo-route','bearing-map','cargo-pickup-map','Cargo pickup map','Locate that remembered approach on the earlier bearing map; this is a short nearby recovery, not an unexplored expedition.')
recipe('cargo-sling','recovery-rope','sled-padding','padded-recovery-sling','Padded sling','Fit the brought padding to the existing recovery rope as the sled’s rated handling sling; detailed load operations are abstracted.')
recipe('cargo-secure','padded-recovery-sling','tagged-cargo-sled','secured-cargo-sled','Secured cargo sled','Attach the sling to the sled’s designed handling points.')
recipe('cargo-bring','secured-cargo-sled','cargo-pickup-map','recovered-mess-crate','Recovered mess crate','Bring the crew’s furniture crate along the checked approach during narrated travel.')
recipe('cargo-unfold','recovered-mess-crate','toolkit','mess-table','Mess table','Release the transport fasteners and unfold the designed crate-table. We recover a place to sit together, not a chain of readiness badges.')
recipe('cargo-pictures','picture-roll','mess-table','personal-table','Personal table','Put the crew’s own photographs under the table’s clear protective cover.')
recipe('cargo-supper','personal-table','soup-flask','shared-supper','Shared supper','Set the still-insulated soup flask at the recovered table: the rescue meal becomes a shared occasion. No second ration is conjured.')
recipe('cargo-portrait','message-camera','shared-supper','crew-table-portrait','Crew portrait','Take a photograph of the reunited crew around their recovered table, a personal image to carry home.')
module('cargo-return','camp','The things we left behind','Before the drive failed we left a small furniture sled beside the route. We remember the way. Bring it back; it has our table and the pictures that made this camp ours.',ss,['crew-table-portrait'],[loc],'The crew identifies its own tagged sled on a nearby known shoulder. Only ordinary recovery padding and their personal picture roll are new loose pieces; the crate unfolds into its original mess table.')
