module('depot-way','contrast','The tracks that were not ours','The depot should be along the old service route, but the dark tracks have changed. Find the permanent markers. Our protected spare controller matches the depot cargo hauler—we can use that to bring the samples to the ship.',ss,['depot-cargo-shuttle'],[loc],'One existing depot navigation-and-maintenance locker holds its original survey print, cleaning pad and folding sign. The stored standardized cargo hauler and platform stand beside it. Their compatible controller specification is legible before installation.')
